<title>FRANCE: PRESS DIGEST - France - Le Monde Sept 9.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - France - Le Monde Sept 9.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are leading stories in afternoon daily Le Monde.</p>
<p>FRONT PAGE</p>
<p>-- Government in talks with civil servants to put an end to wage freeze in 1997.</p>
<p>BUSINESS PAGES</p>
<p>-- George Plassat to succeed Antoine Guichard as chairman of supermarkets group Casino, which posted a 45 percent rise in profits for the first half.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 53 81</p>
